            "notes": "[Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) and [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e) are the best choice for the second round. \n\nIf u don't have enough points go for [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054) It will still be helpful!\n\nPersonally, I always try to hold on to the greens in the early rounds.\nIt\u2019s very unlikely that you won\u2019t have enough points for at least two blues \u2014 it\u2019s more likely that you just can\u2019t afford [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a), in that case I\u2019d rather spend a bit less and keep more attack speed instead.\n\nEven so, if the round went that badly that you\u2019re left with barely any points... well, at that point, go ahead and sell the greens! I\u2019ve noticed a significant difference when running the two-blue combo!",
