            "notes": "At the third round, we unlock the second ability power.\nPersonally, I chose [Renaissance](item_a460f234-6434-4d47-99f9-d4a0b15cd591), because having the option to res doesn\u2019t necessarily mean you\u2019re safe. \n\nEspecially in higher ranks, risky ressurects are always just around the corner \u2014 and they can truly be game-changing.\n\nOf course, we\u2019re not going to charge straight into five enemies waiting for us, but in chaotic situations (and maybe with teammates providing cover or distractions), this early setup should allow us to manage and the mini-ult activation will help keep both us and our team alive.\n\nAs for abilities, [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124) is a classic choice \u2014 not just for Mercy. Every support tends to look at it fondly, since it gives a solid boost to healing output.\n\nFor the second ability, we go with [Angeleisure Wear](item_00b53ed7-0768-442b-a2c3-8d19608c9391), which will help us stay exposed a bit longer than before.\n\nBut don\u2019t get too comfortable \u2014 a good hitscan won\u2019t let you float around for long. So keep moving! A stationary target is a dead one.",
