            "notes": "n the fourth round, it\u2019ll depend on how many points you\u2019ve managed to collect, but as a safe choice, I always go for [Blessed Boosters](item_957fd380-b7b4-40d4-8333-bb8c535ca931)\n\nTo many it might seem like a waste of resources, but flying around at high speed helps us survive longer and support our team more effectively \u2014 especially if they\u2019re playing a dive comp.\n\nIf you\u2019ve saved up even more resources, of course, you can go for optional powers or experiment based on your needs.\n\nI always remind people that making a few adjustments based on your personal playstyle \u2014 or the enemies you're facing \u2014 can only help you secure the win.",
