            "created_at": "2025-09-18T22:45:41.713725+00:00",
            "notes": "By the fifth round, you'll unlock yet another ability power.\nAt this point, you should choose between two paths, depending on how the match is going.\n\n1. Your teammates aren\u2019t surviving very long, and you\u2019re struggling to keep them alive.\nIn this case, go for [Triage Unit](item_fec0554c-2685-4b93-822d-bf0020e654b4) without a second thought.\n\n2. Your team is super efficient; the second support is healing as much as, or even more than you or everyone is doing a great job managing cover and self-sustain.\nIn this case, I\u2019d go for [First Responder](item_30a5c70f-e0b5-489a-96ae-900f34c3823d), as it will only make it easier for you when it\u2019s time to res.\n\nAs for ability, a good choice is [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448), as it will support you in healing whether you went for the first or second option. Of course, I leave other options open if you happen to have plenty of points! :D",
