            "created_at": "2025-09-18T22:45:41.713725+00:00",
            "notes": "By the sixth round, you should be able to purchase [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) and [Resurrection Rangefinder](item_99baffec-51b5-42e4-be61-e29f3de8219f)\n\nBoth will give you massive survivability boosts, ensuring a clean and high-performing round from every angle.\n\nWith [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98), you\u2019ll have a constant healing source that, combined with your flight speed, will drive your enemies crazy.\n\nWith [Resurrection Rangefinder](item_99baffec-51b5-42e4-be61-e29f3de8219f), you\u2019ll be able to res your teammates from a greater distance \u2014 which, by this point, becomes absolutely essential.\n\nJust remember: as the game progresses, not only you, but also your enemies will have more tools in their arsenal!\nEven if you\u2019ve got plenty of survival options, that doesn\u2019t make you invisible \u2014 use your brain!\n\nFor example, a Soldier with aimbot active can still hit you no matter what.\nNo matter how fast or tanky you are, he\u2019ll take you down if you\u2019re not using cover.\nBe smart!",
